{
    "word": "flatmate",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                "word": "flatmate",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5a1af965-ecf3-4c5b-b154-78792e03baf8",
                        "entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "flatmates"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d09e36d-0763-3eb9-8031-9eba22bb4276",
                        "entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with whom one shares a flat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7df020b2-8d29-4a81-a177-740ec5b8e0ea",
                                "sense_id": "7d09e36d-0763-3eb9-8031-9eba22bb4276",
                                "text": "Yet when both Regine and her flatmate are at home they tend to spend their time in their rooms, although Regine (and probably the flatmate too) tends to spend more time in the communal areas of the flat when the other is not at home."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75c56f4e-62dc-434f-9ef1-5fc446e818bb",
                                "sense_id": "7d09e36d-0763-3eb9-8031-9eba22bb4276",
                                "text": "“So, it would probably [be] best if we could find another flatmate and go for a flat of five, and if old Chip does pull out, at least we can then drop down to a flat of four. What do you reckon?”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4269efb-8aa8-4ea4-8fab-2850ae922e58",
                                "sense_id": "7d09e36d-0763-3eb9-8031-9eba22bb4276",
                                "text": "Kamal moved Fathi′s things into his own room, and the two became flatmates.\nThe apartment in which Kamal lived was spacious, with several large rooms and various flatmates."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c924ae06-873e-3690-a74c-a83b67a0ef12",
                        "entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with whom one shares any rental dwelling, not necessarily a flat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ireland",
                            "New-Zealand",
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01191ea4-f0e3-46e8-9ec1-1fdafe064b9c",
                                "sense_id": "c924ae06-873e-3690-a74c-a83b67a0ef12",
                                "text": "It had been weeks since all the flatmates had sat down together for a meal. Communication was breaking down. Written notes had begun to appear all over the house; please don′t touch this food, I bought it especially for Hermione[…]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2149c0a7-2c75-464e-9518-510ddb5c5536",
                                "sense_id": "c924ae06-873e-3690-a74c-a83b67a0ef12",
                                "text": "One night, one of the flatmates (the one who owned the house) was ranting and raving all night about her girlfriend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20debfcb-67bb-445f-b8af-9865e4272ddf",
                                "sense_id": "c924ae06-873e-3690-a74c-a83b67a0ef12",
                                "text": "The position may have been different when your client was living in the house with the flatmates."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30d94ef3-f5b9-46bb-acf6-64ff9e2de418",
                        "source_entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person with whom one shares a flat",
                        "target_lang_word": "huisgenoot",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "huisgenoot",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4376e56b-0638-366d-a476-92a815d91f16",
                                        "entry_id": "75e3ca82-7fb0-3d11-8bf9-1de57ced39d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mensen met wie men in één huis woont, zonder dat er noodzakelijkerwijs ook één huishouding wordt gevoerd"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bc0c1c4-50a7-4a16-81b0-36bced1bb465",
                                                "sense_id": "4376e56b-0638-366d-a476-92a815d91f16",
                                                "text": "In het studentenhuis had ik 5 huisgenoten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac2d0142-7b66-48a4-b636-96491c6e1543",
                                                "sense_id": "4376e56b-0638-366d-a476-92a815d91f16",
                                                "text": "Mijn eerste doel was flexibeler in het leven te staan. Ik hoopte hierdoor geduldiger te worden en meer te gaan genieten van het hier en nu. Maar vooral ook om een aangenamere huisgenoot te worden."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14e3c517-c2dd-4284-bc0c-c1ac823abeb6",
                        "source_entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person with whom one shares a flat",
                        "target_lang_word": "colocataire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "colocataire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72451bd3-296a-3d53-a44a-e1c8b2ec079d",
                                        "entry_id": "e1669f3d-8413-32e0-a42e-ebaba3b14d55",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui vit en colocation, partageant une seule location."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27993d69-d2ed-402f-bb1d-97981c324c2e",
                                                "sense_id": "72451bd3-296a-3d53-a44a-e1c8b2ec079d",
                                                "text": "Appelant à l’aide, elle est secourue par les deux colocataires du prévenu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "613fc7d0-3cd0-4fd5-a2ac-fd8d4c997564",
                                                "sense_id": "72451bd3-296a-3d53-a44a-e1c8b2ec079d",
                                                "text": "Claude commence le travail très tôt le matin et se couche également tôt le soir, alors que son colocataire suit un horaire décalé de plusieurs heures par rapport au sien. Le colocataire de Michel passe souvent la journée à la maison […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fa52ecd-cd25-43d6-b502-8ffd85cd56de",
                                                "sense_id": "72451bd3-296a-3d53-a44a-e1c8b2ec079d",
                                                "text": "Les trois colocataires, bouleversés par la disparition de leur amie, se serrent les coudes comme une vraie famille."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4522a143-0021-3116-bf00-99f6deba2005",
                                        "entry_id": "e1669f3d-8413-32e0-a42e-ebaba3b14d55",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui vit dans un immeuble de location en commun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e604e334-f712-4189-a223-d26816db8a80",
                                                "sense_id": "4522a143-0021-3116-bf00-99f6deba2005",
                                                "text": "En cas d’incendie détruisant l’immeuble loué, tous les locataires sont responsables de l’incendie proportionnellement à la valeur de la partie du bâtiment qu’ils occupent.\nChaque colocataire peut rapporter la preuve que l’incendie n’a pas éclaté chez lui […] ; dans ce cas il n’est pas tenu de participer à l’indemnisation […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6e49607-977a-4244-8b53-51c1e2aa7e4c",
                        "source_entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person with whom one shares a flat",
                        "target_lang_word": "coloc",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coloc",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23ec2476-f94c-3d25-84ac-64209bc37717",
                                        "entry_id": "283621ba-57f3-3207-9cbd-b1570ea6a8e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Colocataire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84c04031-7879-496e-975a-81096d607753",
                                                "sense_id": "23ec2476-f94c-3d25-84ac-64209bc37717",
                                                "text": "On a deux colocs qui sont un peu bricolos, ajoute l’un des éco-colocataires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef5b3aeb-0454-47d1-b467-ffa65e4d440b",
                                                "sense_id": "23ec2476-f94c-3d25-84ac-64209bc37717",
                                                "text": "— Or cette chambre, poursuit-il, appartient maintenant à… Bridgette, que voici, ta nouvelle coloc.\nJ’en reste un instant sans voix. Pourquoi dit-il que c’est ma coloc ? Je proteste :\n— Comment ça, coloc ? Personne ne m’a demandé si je voulais une nouvelle coloc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "coloc",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "743ca858-80aa-395e-bcdc-89d6b9945f81",
                                        "entry_id": "938f445b-084c-3c95-a6d1-a784861e2f45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Colocation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c4dae38-09eb-4219-80dd-19221c50c3f4",
                                                "sense_id": "743ca858-80aa-395e-bcdc-89d6b9945f81",
                                                "text": "[…], alors il m’a expédié à Madrid, chez ma tante qui est mariée à un Espagnol […] mais vu que, entre nous, ça ne s’est pas passé génial non plus, j’ai fini par aboutir ici, en coloc."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a951531f-6d5f-4451-a7b3-908a6330acb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person with whom one shares a flat",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mitbewohner",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mitbewohner",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88288791-f23d-3f88-8f1d-8757326a017f",
                                        "entry_id": "b2770539-3be0-3358-8cdd-278659be462b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, mit dem man sich ein Haus, eine Wohnung oder ein Zimmer teilt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1a1aadf-b529-45fe-970f-9bd4c9f09c92",
                                                "sense_id": "88288791-f23d-3f88-8f1d-8757326a017f",
                                                "text": "Ich wohne in einer Wohngemeinschaft mit zwei weiteren Mitbewohnern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c0d8c61-e3ad-4994-9bc4-8a92d644e442",
                                                "sense_id": "88288791-f23d-3f88-8f1d-8757326a017f",
                                                "text": "„Den Kindern des Hauses, darunter Clara, bereitete der neue Mitbewohner viel Freude.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64e2df0c-41d5-4b5e-8e05-3c654ca20c4a",
                                                "sense_id": "88288791-f23d-3f88-8f1d-8757326a017f",
                                                "text": "„Schau dir das Fotoalbum deines Mitbewohners an und frag, wer wer ist.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e99e426-b601-4133-b2cb-cfc40a38ce2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "34540db6-5445-3453-9984-1b7f586167e7",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person with whom one shares a flat",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mitbewohnerin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mitbewohnerin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62695de8-c7f5-33ba-9306-e14bba2bb4e5",
                                        "entry_id": "c7b7920b-6aaa-3ded-b4fe-8228d7de3ade",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weibliche Person, mit der jemand sich ein Haus, eine Wohnung oder ein Zimmer teilt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93fc7dc7-d6db-46ae-a47b-7230455750f3",
                                                "sense_id": "62695de8-c7f5-33ba-9306-e14bba2bb4e5",
                                                "text": "„Weil sich Peter Sim seit Einzug seiner neuen Mitbewohnerin so langweilt, schreibt er Tweets und ab jetzt auch Notizen für diese Kolumne“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aabaa693-b7ba-4a89-afa4-afcfd7d487cc",
                                                "sense_id": "62695de8-c7f5-33ba-9306-e14bba2bb4e5",
                                                "text": "„Wenige Tage später kommen Thomas und Mona Sendler mit einer anderen Mitbewohnerin des Hauses, der sehr korpulenten und resolut auftretenden Marina Graf, ins Gespräch.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cac52cad-6734-4007-bc79-8fa2fe066d1b",
                                                "sense_id": "62695de8-c7f5-33ba-9306-e14bba2bb4e5",
                                                "text": "„Als kleiner Junge jedoch war er – wegen des Altersunterschieds leider hoffnungslos – in seine hübsche Mitbewohnerin Ruth verliebt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
